OL,3,CZack Polanski says he made
OL,4,C'inadvertent mistake' over social
OL,5,Cmedia image
OL,7,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski said
OL,8,Fhe made an "inadvertent mistake" over
OL,9,Fa social media image but will not
OL,10,Fapologise to Nigel Farage.
OL,12,FThe image, which Mr Polanski said he
OL,13,F"shared inadvertently" on Instagram
OL,14,Fand then removed, featured a man
OL,15,Fwearing a black T-shirt with the
OL,16,Fmessage "We're only making plans for
OL,17,FNigel" and an image of a guillotine.
OL,26,@pD@LOUpD@`O]uD@AOUuD@VO]xD@IOUyD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
