CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785316716
OL,3,CZack Polanski says he made
OL,4,C'inadvertent mistake' over social
OL,5,Cmedia image
OL,7,FReform UK said the party had reported
OL,8,FMr Polanski to the police, with home
OL,9,Faffairs spokesman Zia Yusuf accusing
OL,10,Fthe Green leader of "inciting murder"
OL,11,Fand Nigel Farage calling for his
OL,12,Farrest.
OL,14,FA Metropolitan Police spokesman said
OL,15,Fthe force was "conducting inquiries"
OL,16,Fand took "reports of this nature
OL,17,Fextremely seriously".
OL,26,@rD@UOUrD@eO]wD@OOUwD@dO]xD@JOUyD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785316716
OL,3,CZack Polanski says he made
OL,4,C'inadvertent mistake' over social
OL,5,Cmedia image
OL,7,FMr Polanski told BBC Newsnight on
OL,8,FTuesday evening that the police had
OL,9,Fnot been in contact with him, adding
OL,10,Fthat he "didn't pay enough attention
OL,11,Fto the T-shirt" and was "horrified" by
OL,12,Fits "dangerous message".
OL,14,FThe Green Party leader said: "This was
OL,15,Fnot my post, it was a collaboration
OL,16,Ffrom a photographer.
OL,18,F"It had 20 images and I just didn't
OL,19,Flook carefully enough and I accepted
OL,20,Fit.
OL,26,@rD@IOUsD@OO]sD@YOUsD@cO]tD@EOUtD@WO]vD@
OL,26,A^OUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785316716
OL,3,CZack Polanski says he made
OL,4,C'inadvertent mistake' over social
OL,5,Cmedia image
OL,7,F"As soon as I was aware of what
OL,8,Fhappened, I unaccepted it and took it
OL,9,Fdown.
OL,11,F"I think it would be odd for the
OL,12,Fpolice to speak to me about that
OL,13,Fbecause I think it's quite obvious
OL,14,Fthat I've not done anything wrong
OL,15,Fother than making an inadvertent
OL,16,Fmistake.
OL,18,F"That being said, if the police do
OL,19,Fwant to talk to me, of course I'm very
OL,20,Fhappy to co-operate."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUzD@AOU|D@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
