OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785316716
OL,3,CZack Polanski says he made
OL,4,C'inadvertent mistake' over social
OL,5,Cmedia image
OL,7,FMr Polanski said he would not be
OL,8,Fapologising to Mr Farage, adding: "If
OL,9,FI'd done it deliberately, I'd be
OL,10,Fapologising.
OL,12,F"But because this was a mistake, I
OL,13,Fthink the important thing is that I
OL,14,Fpoint out it's a mistake, that I also
OL,15,Fmake sure that I condemn political
OL,16,Fviolence, and also crucially, I make a
OL,17,Fcommitment to be better on my social
OL,18,Fmedia."
OL,26,@pD@cOUtD@AOUzD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
