PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785316716
OL,3,CZack Polanski says he made
OL,4,C'inadvertent mistake' over social
OL,5,Cmedia image
OL,7,FHe added: "It's not the first time
OL,8,FZack Polanski has done something like
OL,9,Fthis."
OL,11,FMr Polanski has previously been
OL,12,Fcriticised over his use of social
OL,13,Fmedia.
OL,15,FIn May, he apologised for sharing a
OL,16,Fpost criticising the police response
OL,17,Fto the Golders Green stabbings, saying
OL,18,Fhe had done so "in haste".
OL,26,@oD@KOUqD@FO]zD@POUzD@YO]
